## Timezone Fix Content Patch

The AI assignment display issue (8-hour off dates) has also been resolved. 

### What went wrong
Because Canvas reports and synchronizes assignment `due_at` datetimes as naive/aware UTC objects under the hood, any direct string formatting within the backend system prompts (or tools like [search_assignments](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#62-102)) simply passed the exact UTC timestamp to Gemini.

### Fix
Created an explicit [utc_to_sg](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/lib/timezone.py#11-18) timezone mutation helper within [backend/lib/timezone.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/lib/timezone.py). Both the RAG injection code in [_build_brief_chat_context](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/routers/brief.py#312-472) and the structured tool data returned by [search_assignments](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#62-102) now guarantee all assignment dates conform to `Asia/Singapore` UI specs before the LLM ever sees them.

